 "words": 252,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "If we have food and clothing we are content",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Those who want to get rich fall into a trap",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Many senseless desires plunge people into ruin",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A trap for the soul and a harmful desire",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Love of money is a root of all kinds of evil",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Reaching for it they have wandered away from faith",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Pierced through with many sorrows and deep despair",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They have lost their way in the world of pain",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Flee from all this man of God today",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Pursue righteousness and godliness and faith",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Endurance and love and gentleness keep close",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hold on to the life that is yours to keep",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Fight the good fight of the faith with all your might",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Take hold of the eternal life you were called to",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You made the good confession before many witnesses",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stand firm in the truth that you have received",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Flee from all this man of God today",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Pursue righteousness and godliness and faith",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Endurance and love and gentleness keep close",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hold on to the life that is yours to keep",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the presence of God who gives life to all",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Before Christ Jesus who confessed before Pilate",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep this command without stain or any reproach",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Until the appearing of our Lord Jesus",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
